# HUD

- Contract: `docs/hud.md` (HUD-first after phase 10). Store/bus first; no UI-only verdicts.
- New operator capability → extend HUD API+SPA+tests **or** defer explicitly in brief +
  `hud.md` evolution + `docs/phases/BACKLOG.md`.
- Secrets: show env **names** only; never token/key values in Profiles JSON or API payloads.
- Mutators: localhost + CSRF; respect `--read-only`. Artifacts only under `artifacts_dir`.
- Rebuild SPA: `hud/frontend` → embed into `src/questline/hud/static/` when UI changes.
- GameLens panel is deferred (CLI `questline lens` MVP) until FP-G2/G3 data is worth browsing.
